+# Guide
+
+Never add `@ts-ignore`, `eslint-disable`, `istanbul ignore`, `nosemgrep` or `gitleaks:allow`.
+Never write `console.log` or `process.stdout.write` in library code, and never bind `0.0.0.0` or `::`.
+Do not leave `throw new Error('Not implemented')`, an empty `catch {}` or a TODO behind, and do not use `describe.skip`, `it.todo`, `xit` or `xdescribe`.
